//! The built-in layer types, outside the engine.
//!
//! Each type is a module that holds its style half, a marker type that
//! implements `mln_style`'s `StyleLayerType`, with its property sets
//! (`properties.rs`, generated by //tools/style-codegen from the style
//! spec), and its render half, which implements `mln_render`'s `Layer`: a
//! type that lays out also has its bucket and its layout.
//!
//! A type that draws also has its programs, the uniform blocks its shaders
//! read, and its programs' sources in each shading language of the crate's
//! features: `wgsl`, `msl`, `glsl-es` and `glsl`, which the facade's backend
//! features turn on. [`PROGRAMS`] lists the programs.

